%% LYAdmin 日志记录方案重构 · 关键流程时序图
%% 覆盖：① 请求 → 访问日志双写（文件 + DB） ② 启动/定时 → 归档昨日 ③ 查询 HTTP 日志 ④ 清空 HTTP 日志

%% ① 一次请求 → 访问日志双写（物理文件留痕 + 数据库供页面查询）
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant C as Client
  participant MW as httpAccessLogger
  participant CTRL as Controller/Service
  participant LM as LogManager
  participant FS as 物理文件
  participant ST as HttpLogStore
  participant DB as MySQL

  C->>MW: HTTP 请求 /api/xxx
  MW->>MW: 记录起始时间，拦截 res 收集响应体
  MW->>CTRL: next()
  CTRL-->>C: 业务响应
  Note over MW: res 'finish' 事件触发
  MW->>MW: 组装 AccessLogRecord（脱敏/截断）
  MW->>LM: writeLog('access', record)
  LM->>LM: 以“当前本地日期”计算 dateKey 取/建写入流
  LM->>FS: 追加一行 JSON 到 logs/access/2026-9-24.log
  MW->>ST: appendHttpLog(record)  (fire-and-forget，不阻塞响应)
  ST->>DB: INSERT INTO sys_http_log ...
  Note over MW,ST: 任一步骤失败仅 console.error，绝不影响业务响应

%% ② 启动 / 每天定时 → 归档“昨日”日志为 .tar.gz
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant SRV as server.bootstrap
  participant SCH as LogScheduler
  participant AR as Archiver
  participant LM as LogManager
  participant TAR as 系统 tar (child_process)
  participant FS as 物理文件

  SRV->>SCH: startLogScheduler()
  SCH->>AR: archivePastLogs()  启动补跑
  loop 每种日志类型 access/db/error
    AR->>FS: 扫描 logs/<type>/ 下日期 < 今天 的 *.log
    alt 源文件存在且归档不存在
      AR->>LM: closeStream(type, date)  释放句柄（Windows 关键）
      AR->>TAR: execFile('tar', ['-czf', archivePath, '-C', srcDir, fileName])
      TAR-->>AR: 完成
      AR->>FS: 按配置删除源文件（keepSource=false 时）
    else 归档已存在
      AR-->>AR: 跳过（幂等，重复启动不覆盖）
    end
  end
  SCH->>SCH: 计算到次日 00:05 的毫秒数，setTimeout
  Note over SCH: 定时到点 → archivePastLogs() → 再次自我调度（重算延迟，防 DST 漂移）

%% ③ GET /api/logs/http（改为查数据库，筛选/分页/字段不变）
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant C as Client(前端零改动)
  participant RT as log.routes
  participant CTRL as log.controller
  participant SV as log.service
  participant ST as HttpLogStore
  participant DB as MySQL

  C->>RT: GET /api/logs/http?page&pageSize&method&statusCode&startTime&endTime
  RT->>CTRL: httpLogs(req)
  CTRL->>SV: listHttpLogs(query)
  SV->>ST: queryHttpLogs(query)
  ST->>DB: SELECT ... WHERE (method/status_code/time 范围) ORDER BY time DESC, id DESC LIMIT
  DB-->>ST: rows + count
  ST-->>SV: PageResult<HttpLogItem>
  SV-->>CTRL: PageResult<HttpLogItem>
  CTRL-->>C: {code:200,data,message}

%% ④ DELETE /api/logs/http（只清数据库，物理文件不动）
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant C as Client(前端零改动)
  participant CTRL as log.controller
  participant SV as log.service
  participant ST as HttpLogStore
  participant DB as MySQL
  participant FS as 物理文件(不受影响)

  C->>CTRL: DELETE /api/logs/http
  CTRL->>SV: clearHttpLogs()
  SV->>ST: clearHttpLogsDb()
  ST->>DB: TRUNCATE TABLE sys_http_log
  CTRL-->>C: {code:200,message:'已清空所有 HTTP 日志'}
  Note over FS: logs/access/*.log 物理文件保持不变（需求 4）
